{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Mayor [Insert Mayor's Name Here]! And congratulations on obtaining this much revered position! Sadly, after your predecessor mysteriously disappeared, it is now your job to achieve greatness in Cardopolis.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take control of the city!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Mayor of Cardopolis, you will be given full authority to control both the design and laws of the city.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932910/extras/e25f0d9b54506562ae6722cabeef57b6.avif?t=1770395459\" width=381 height=93 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach the expected population goals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your investors expect a lot from you, and they are especially interested in you reaching the Population target of each sector. Be careful though! If you fail to reach it, you might join your missing predecessor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932910/extras/b47a2b9b007366db1e46fb4d5c5f4c0f.apng?t=1770395459\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932910/extras/b47a2b9b007366db1e46fb4d5c5f4c0f.poster.avif?t=1770395459\" class=\"bb_img\" width=335 height=60 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a city with an ever growing population, sector by sector!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use up to 50 different Legislation Cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use up to 150 Building Cards to populate your city!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 5 completely different themed Building Decks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed your city? Enjoy the 