ially interested in you reaching the Population target of each sector. Be careful though! If you fail to reach it, you might join your missing predecessor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932910/extras/b47a2b9b007366db1e46fb4d5c5f4c0f.apng?t=1770395459\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932910/extras/b47a2b9b007366db1e46fb4d5c5f4c0f.poster.avif?t=1770395459\" class=\"bb_img\" width=335 height=60 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a city with an ever growing population, sector by sector!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use up to 50 different Legislation Cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use up to 150 Building Cards to populate your city!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 5 completely different themed Building Decks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed your city? Enjoy the endless mode and build the biggest city you can!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Pulse Rider"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932910/0f0eb50165b4a463f98c45708c081bfeafa9b804/header.jpg?t=1770395459","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1932910/2012055844/3b7dc24e633c056820888ab58d2c59206263bc34/1756059385/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758663523","dash_h264":"https://